{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================================
  SCENTSPIRED — Product Card (carousel variant)
  ============================================================================
  The single definition of the carousel card markup, used by Video-banner1,
  featuredscent, main-collection-product-grid and mobile-video-banner. Each of
  those previously carried its own copy inside a JavaScript template literal.

  Why this exists separately from card--product:

    card--product           .product-form / .selected-variant-id
                            .compare-price / .sale-badge          (43 CSS rules)
    card--product-carousel  .item-form / .variant-id-input
                            .original-price / .price-badge        (2 CSS rules)

  The two families use different class hooks and those hooks are styled
  differently, so merging them means a CSS change, not just a markup change.
  Kept apart deliberately; see TODO.md for the eventual merge.

  Element tags were safe to unify — no CSS anywhere targets `h3.fragrance-name`
  or `p.fragrance-brand`, only the bare class.

  Markup is the superset of the four consumers. Sections that do not use the
  compare price or sale badge simply leave those fields off the product object
  and the renderer removes them.

  Usage:
      {% render 'card--product-carousel' %}
      <script src="{{ 'card--product.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
      ...
      wrap.appendChild(ScentspiredCard.renderCarousel(product, { index: i }));
  ============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<template id="card--product-carousel">
  <div class="fragrance-item product-card" data-card-root>
    <a class="fragrance-image-wrap" data-card-image-link>
      <img class="product-main-image" data-card-image alt="">
      <img class="product-hover-image" data-card-hover-image alt="" hidden>
      <div class="product-badges" data-card-badges></div>
    </a>

    <div class="fragrance-info">
      <a style="text-decoration: none;" data-card-title-link>
        <div class="fragrance-name" data-card-title></div>
      </a>

      <div class="fragrance-brand" data-card-vendor></div>

      <div class="price-section">
        <span class="product-price-display" data-price-display></span>
        <span class="original-price" data-compare-at-price-display style="display: none;"></span>
        <span class="price-badge" data-price-badge style="display: none;">Sale</span>
      </div>

      <form class="item-form" method="post" action="/cart/add" data-card-form>
        <div class="variant-options" data-card-variants hidden></div>
        <input type="hidden" name="id" class="variant-id-input">
        <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
        <button type="submit" class="cart-button" data-card-submit>ADD TO CART</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</template>
